('waterproof-shower-curtain-liner', 'Waterproof Shower Curtain Liner', 'home-living', 'Textiles', 'Heavy-duty 72 by 72 inch liner, soap scum resistant and easy to clean.', 'A heavy-duty waterproof shower curtain liner, 72 by 72 inches, with two pieces in the pack. Soap scum resistant, PVC free and easy to wipe clean.', 8.95, 'HOME-018', ARRAY[]::text[], ARRAY['Clear'], ARRAY['/images/61b5r00gm9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg','/images/71Q+3qia+vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg','/images/71V7L0wjQ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg','/images/71w9imy7Y4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg'], 50, 'active', 'all', false, false, false),
